e plasma cutter mounted aboard alien Herald drones, this enhanced cutting tool doubles as an awesome terror weapon, potentially carving through entire squads of lesser beings at close range.\n\nFusion cutters are a special kind of plasma weapon unique to the Herald, featuring unlimited ammo and excellent suppression and anti-armor damage, at the cost of extremely low range, no overwatch capability, and low damage per hit.\n\nThis fusion cutter has a range dropoff of 20% (ballistics are 10%), and a 25% chance of starting a fire with each shot.","$t":"Description"}],"$t":"4"},"$t":"15"}